From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 1 Nov 2026 23:56:12 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 4/8] Two blows only; the cave's clock tells the story's time;
 no sound off the page; the chapter selector closes itself

- The fight plays only the last two blows of the animation, the swing between them quickened so
  they land 0.28 s apart, each with its exhale (as in the recordings); the second is the uppercut.
- The rack's clock in the cave read 14:47 (modelled): it shows chapter 3's time, 00:32.
- Leaving the page (another tab, minimised, another app) fades the sound out and stops the audio;
  coming back brings it back as it was.
- The chapter selector closes by itself after taking you to a chapter.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_017Yfam9H7FbQFsBx6yJZ8yW
